**/tests/snapshots/**/*.diff.png
**/tests/snapshots/**/*.new.png
**/tests/snapshots/**/*.old.png
# rustfmt backups, MSVC debug info, cargo-mutants output, rustc crash dumps
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
**/mutants.out*/
rustc-ice-*.txt
